---
import Layout from '../layouts/layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Compliance">
	<main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-8 py-32 bg-slate-50">
		<h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 mb-4">Compliance & Certifications</h1>
		<p class="text-slate-500 mb-12">Last updated: October 24, 2024</p>

		<div class="space-y-8 text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
			<section>
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">Financial & Data Standards</h2>
				<p>RMG Technologies adheres to the highest standards of data protection and financial compliance. Our infrastructure is designed to meet the rigorous demands of international markets and defense sectors.</p>
				<ul class="list-disc pl-5 mt-4 space-y-2 text-slate-600">
					<li><strong>SOC 2 Type II:</strong> Independent audits of our security, availability, and confidentiality controls.</li>
					<li><strong>GDPR Compliant:</strong> Strict data privacy protocols for our European clients.</li>
					<li><strong>ISO/IEC 27001:</strong> Certified information security management systems.</li>
				</ul>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">Defense & Export Controls</h2>
				<p>Our military-grade software solutions are subject to strict export control regulations. Clients utilizing our Defense Division are required to provide verified entity documentation before API access is granted.</p>
			</section>
		</div>
	</main>
</Layout>